text = "• [b]Original Audio & Content[/b]: All voice lines, announcer jokes, heckling commentary scripts, and audio cues included in Heckle Golf Simulator are original creative works and comedic parodies produced specifically for this simulator.

• [b]Homage & Fair Expression[/b]: References to classic PlayStation 2 era golf video games represent an artistic homage and comedic inspiration to the arcade sports genre. This project does not use or redistribute any proprietary audio samples, sound effects, voice recordings, or trademarked characters belonging to Sony Interactive Entertainment, Electronic Arts, or any commercial game publisher."
